 "notes": [
  "The list has no starting section; the strategy says to start Squadron Assignments, Battle Plan and Your Insight Serves You Well. Several Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty. All are in the list and count toward the 60 (total 60).",
  "Posted 'Han with Blaster Slapper', 'Luke with Blade Slapper', 'Leia With Blaster Slapper' and 'Lando with Blaster Slapper' dested the Enhanced cards Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Luke With Lightsaber, Leia With Blaster Rifle and Lando With Blaster Pistol (Lando With Blaster Rifle is a later virtual card).",
  "Posted 'Chewie with his \"grr\" gun' dested Chewie With Blaster Rifle, the only Chewie 'With' character of the era, alongside the other Enhanced characters in the list.",
  "Posted 'Rebel Scout Luke (Scout)' dested Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'Transimitte T/OOC' dested Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Grimtaash/Shocking information' dested Shocking Information & Grimtaash.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine', 'Cantina' and 'Tatooine DB' dested the Light Premiere Tatooine, Tatooine: Cantina and Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Your insights Serve you well' dested the Death Star II Effect Your Insight Serves You Well (the Staging Areas combo is later).",
  "Byline 'steven \"Harpster\" Harpster' credited to the existing [[Steve Harpster]] page (HARPSTER redirects there); a separate [[Harpster]] page covers a 2010 Worlds Day 2 player."
 ],
